('generated',(P,29),row('PrintJobDto projects job identity,OrderId/Number,Route/Status,attempt count,last time/error,reprint and createdtime. Generated properties do not poll or validate enum strings;value equality snapshots metadata only. Nonorder document jobs may encode synthetic order identity through DocumentPrintJobs,so OrderId is not necessarily actual sale foreign key. Error may contain machine paths/transport destination from agent. Succeeded is reporter/transport state,not paper proof.','Ten stored queue fields.','Job view/API polling row.','No retry/printing from constructor/copy.','Read DTO can expose error/device metadata;not authority to mark job succeeded.','CreatePrintJobsHandler.ToDto102-104,PrintJobQueryService queries;record no DB.','AttemptCount not receipt copies;IsReprint not suppressed kitchen;PRT002 physical distinction.','Scalar/string equality small but Error length variable.','with copy locally alters state but cannot commit;two queries may produce equal job with different unseen attempt history.','Status enum validity and order/document interpretation enforced elsewhere.',['Nonorder job identity,nullable error/times,huge error,pending/success not physical paper'],['PrintingRequests.cs29-31','CreatePrintJobsHandler.ToDto','DocumentPrintJobs.Build','PrintJobProcessor error formatting'])),
('generated',(P,40),row('PrintRouteStatusDto contains route and current Pending/Failed/Stuck counts,oldest pending time,last success time. Constructor does not enforce Stuck<=Pending or zero pending implies null oldest. Query computes stuck from5minute age and success from loaded2day window;record generated equality compares exact timestamps/counts,not actual printer online state. No heartbeat/device-health property exists.','Route,three ints,two nullable timestamps.','Queue-derived route summary.','No probe or job mutation.','Server computed queue observation,not agent-authenticated hardware heartbeat.','PrintJobQueryService49-68 producer;record no SQL.','Failed/stuck differentiations UI;last succeeded may be null outside query lookback despite historical paper.','Constant scalar behavior;route count six producer.','with inconsistent counts possible;value equality not dependable printer-health check.','Age threshold merely queue symptom,not verified printer fault.',['Stuck threshold boundary,old success outside2days,zero pending nulloldest,counts consistency'],['PrintingRequests.cs40-42','PrintJobQueryService.GetOverviewAsync49-68'])),
('generated',(P,44),row('PrintingOverviewDto stores Routes and NeedsAttention IReadOnlyList refs plus total counts. Generated with-copy/equality is shallow for both lists;no recompute totals from route modifications. Producer includes6route summaries and attention capped60 while totals cover all loaded jobs,so NeedsAttention.Count need not equal total failed+stuck. Generated record does not claim queue ownership/lease or printer state.','Two list references,three total ints.','Composite queue overview JSON.','No print/retry/claim.','Session-visible operation/error metadata;constructor no policy.','PrintJobQueryService49-86 reads current/recent jobs;DTO no SQL.','UI must display6routes or explicitly hide;record not4printer topology limit.','List serialization vs source full query;no paging token generated.','Copies share backing lists;independent deserialized equalcontent records may compare unequal.','Attention cap60 means overview list not exhaustive matching totals.',['More60failed,route total consistency,shallow list alias,all6 routes and no physical status inference'],['PrintingRequests.cs44-47','PrintJobQueryService49-86','PrintingViewModel route cards'])),
