('generated',(P,58),row('PrintJobAttemptDto contains AttemptedAtUtc,Succeeded,nullableError and ReportedBy display name. Generated scalar equality captures exact reported observation,not attempt stable ID (not included). Attempts query cannot uniquely identify same-time attempts from DTO fields alone,and caller-reported name/status not device acknowledgement. ToString includes error/name,so broad logging may reveal paths/user attribution.','Four attempt projection fields.','Attempt history row.','No retry or report submission.','Persisted observation read boundary,not signed printer evidence.','PrintJobQueryService88-97 projects stored attempts;record no SQL.','Succeeded still PRT002 transport-only;time reporter server recorded.','Small scalar view;history size query unbounded.','Equality can collapse distinct identical same-time attempts if consumers dedupe by DTO;no such actual dedupe established.','No attempt/requestID available in contract.',['Same-time identical attempts retained,nullableerror,reportedname changes,history order tie'],['PrintingRequests.cs58','PrintJobQueryService.GetJobDetailsAsync88-97'])),
